        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop, design, manufacture and service custom-engineered equipment and systems that distribute, control and monitor the flow of electrical energy and provide protection to motors, transformers and other electrically powered equipment.",
